{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x246ddd",
      "back_en": "keep an eye on the Tuskur ambassadors for Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido preservado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24730c",
      "back_en": "ambassadors.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Direto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x248b40",
      "back_en": "That thing SPOKE to me!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Ênfase mantida."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x248ba4",
      "back_en": "You don't even believe me, do you, Ougi!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x248d4f",
      "back_en": "At the time, the Ku was a problematic young woman.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'maiden'=donzela; gênero inconsistente ('o Ku' + 'jovem problemática')."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x248e79",
      "back_en": "called love.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24901d",
      "back_en": "in her bed.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2491d4",
      "back_en": "Dear sister would... wet her bed...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2493a6",
      "back_en": "That's why the Ku was so deeply distressed.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x249422",
      "back_en": "embarrassment, tears in her eyes.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'welling' omitido mas aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x249536",
      "back_en": "both here. Good to see you again.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24a24a",
      "back_en": "The statue of the Mikado.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24ab0f",
      "back_en": "Allow me! Here, orkes race each other, and",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'shi' é o sotaque/cicio intencional de Maroro."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24ab41",
      "back_en": "spectators wager on the results. It's related",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Grafia 'osh/nosh' = cicio intencional."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24b024",
      "back_en": "Indeed, gambling can be considered a type of",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'sher' = cicio intencional."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24b43c",
      "back_en": "I can tell what they're saying.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x246d4a",
      "back_en": "Huh... I was just going to lie down a bit after eating,",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'depois de comer' adicionado; não está no segmento fonte."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x246f84",
      "back_en": "Yamato seems pretty anxious about all this.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2470f2",
      "back_en": "Of course, worrying about that",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2474ee",
      "back_en": "Do you think skipping the meeting would really be a",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Perde a negação 'Don't you think' (Você não acha que)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x247885",
      "back_en": "in talks with the officials...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2479f4",
      "back_en": "She's been so cold to us.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'recently' implícito; aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x247b58",
      "back_en": "well.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x247ce8",
      "back_en": "But it sounds like someone's inside.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x247da4",
      "back_en": "reply at first, but I hear a tired voice",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x247dd4",
      "back_en": "coffee.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'inside' traduzido como 'café'; erro de sentido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x248218",
      "back_en": "I just don't know what to do about them.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x248243",
      "back_en": "They're... overprotective.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2484bb",
      "back_en": "But as soon as she notices my gaze, she quickly",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x248607",
      "back_en": "Is that... true?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24864a",
      "back_en": "then.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2488b8",
      "back_en": "guests/diners.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'convivas' adequado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x248b22",
      "back_en": "I'm serious, it's true!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'falando sério' por 'telling you'; aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x248d8f",
      "back_en": "Yeah... There was something troubling Kuon",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'deeply' omitido mas ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24934c",
      "back_en": "True, but being her rite ceremony",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Omite 'adolescence' (rito de adolescência)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2494c9",
      "back_en": "The door opens with a slam, drawing",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x249747",
      "back_en": "I look back to see what Camyu and Aruruu",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2499c5",
      "back_en": "continuing forward.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24a0f5",
      "back_en": "In the Imperial Cloister, there's a large library",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'huge'→'grande'; menor."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24a162",
      "back_en": "Oh... Maybe it won't work. The Cloister",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24a4a3",
      "back_en": "...Now that I think about it, I still need to",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24a538",
      "back_en": "too.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24a882",
      "back_en": "to escort a lady!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24a988",
      "back_en": "Really? I want to see it. Take us there!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24ab01",
      "back_en": "A race track?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24ac58",
      "back_en": "palm wearily against her forehead.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24acfb",
      "back_en": "that national guests normally wouldn't see",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'wouldn't be brought (to see)' passivo→'não veriam' ativo; muda voz/sentido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24add0",
      "back_en": "Ah, no...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'crap' suavizado mas tom mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24afc8",
      "back_en": "Kuon's tail tightens around me like a vise.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'vice'=torno; correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24b0be",
      "back_en": "go?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24b3a1",
      "back_en": "animals. Some say they can even converse with",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24b4fe",
      "back_en": "Me...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24b91a",
      "back_en": "It's just... my own personal hunch, you see!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24b9ec",
      "back_en": "Oh... OK. I already had a feeling something",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido mantido."
    }
  ],
